  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Entry Points for Advancing Regional Security and Cooperation in the Gulf (and Beyond)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall aim of the project is to contribute to improving regional security in the wider Gulf region. It establishes regional formats to promote confidence-building and cooperation, to develop options to enhancing channels of communication and to design mechanisms to prevent escalation and increase coordination in relation to maritime security and disaster response. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
